  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0: Blazor Server support (AddSuperAdminBlazor, [HasUrlPermission], SaCan, SuperAdminMenu, revalidating auth state). IDbContextFactory. Database:Mode (Auto/Create/Migrate/None) with fail-fast schema checks. Install/upgrade SQL scripts for SQL Server, PostgreSQL, MySQL, Oracle and SQLite (sql/ folder, GenerateSuperAdminSqlScript, superadmin sql-script). The generated admin password is never logged. User import with existing password hashes. Extra user attributes (JSON). Events and operation log sinks. UI on/off. TimeProvider. Static assets and Blazor framework requests need no URL rule. Upgrading from 0.1.x: add the sa_users.Attributes column (sql/*/0002_user_attributes.sql or Mode Create), and set Seed:AdminPassword in production. 0.1.x logged the generated admin password: upgrade and rotate it. Full list: CHANGELOG.md in the repository.",
